    /* "fusion", declared on .theme-espnDS_v2 itself, is a second semantic token set over the
       combo tokens above; its LIGHT values ship on every next-gen page and --text-default alone
       is `#000`. Mirrors ESPN's own .theme-espnDS_v2Dark. */
    --text-default: #c4cdd6 !important;
